WEBVTT

00:19.525 --> 00:24.648
The living room was quiet The carpet soft and

00:24.708 --> 00:32.513
warm Just staring at the CRT before the storm was

00:32.573 --> 00:39.497
born A flash of blinding purple A crackle in the

00:41.258 --> 00:46.713
air The glass just opened up And swallowed us in

00:46.773 --> 00:50.636
there Static and pixels Falling through the

00:50.656 --> 00:53.898
screen Into a digital nightmare A twisted

00:53.978 --> 00:57.200
glowing dream The smell of burning ozone The

00:57.220 --> 01:00.982
heavy basement air I'm holding on to you But

01:01.002 --> 01:06.345
you're not really there Static and pixels

01:06.365 --> 01:06.485
Static

01:12.389 --> 01:15.113
and pixels you

01:37.535 --> 01:42.482
The scrying terminal's broken, wires on the

01:42.642 --> 01:49.352
floor I hear the heavy footsteps coming down the

01:49.412 --> 01:50.714
corridor

01:52.857 --> 01:57.241
You're reading from the parchment A dark and

01:57.301 --> 02:04.147
cursed light I've got to find a way To get us

02:04.227 --> 02:08.390
through the night Static and pixel Falling

02:08.410 --> 02:11.553
through the screen Into a digital nightmare A

02:11.593 --> 02:14.355
twisted growing dream The smell of burning

02:14.475 --> 02:18.138
ozone The heavy basement air I'm holding on to

02:18.178 --> 02:23.384
you But you're not really there Static and

02:23.444 --> 02:23.866
pixels

02:53.897 --> 02:59.962
They think they can erase us All over in the color

03:00.002 --> 03:08.589
blue But I got golden magic Hidden in my love Just

03:08.649 --> 03:09.870
hold on to me

03:16.151 --> 03:18.275
STATIC PIXELS

